// ext publishes no tags for several modules these adapters need (pkg/ext-go/core,
// pkg/ext-go/cengine, src/ctn/*, src/cto/sandbox), and its tagged modules require them.
// Pin every ext module to one ext commit until ext tags releases; then delete this block.
